option "operating_currency" "USD"

; A pad on a cash account, dated before the budget start. Beancount's
; beancount.ops.pad synthesizes an opening-balance transaction from it, so the
; pool is 1000.00 when tracking starts. A plugin that runs before pad sees no
; such transaction and computes a pool of 0, which makes the allocation below
; look like a negative pool (W001) the report never shows.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Checking USD
  cash-account: TRUE
2020-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances USD
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Groceries USD
  envelope: "Groceries"

2020-01-01 pad Assets:Checking Equity:Opening-Balances
2020-01-02 balance Assets:Checking 1000.00 USD

2024-01-01 custom "envelope" "start"
2024-01-01 custom "envelope" "open" "Groceries"
2024-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Groceries" 500.00 USD
